    "id": "261004-refactor-customer-login",
    "label": "refactor-customer-login",
    "description": "Refactor customer login to a backend proxy with opaque Kratos identifiers (partially supersedes ADR-0013): mobile sends email/phone + password to identity-service; identity-service HMACs via OpenBao, looks up the Kratos identifier in the PII vault (existing users keep their current login_id string, new users get a random opaque id), drives Kratos native API flows server-to-server (login, registration, verification, recovery via admin recovery code, settings password change, logout), returns the session token. Remove the public resolve endpoint /v1/auth/identifiers (oracle C1) and the extra client round trip (C3). Update mobile app, docs (ADR-0014, chapter 10, roadmap) and tests.",
